---
const features = [
  'CMS-1500 compatible documentation ready for submission',
  'Exact clinician review minutes logged automatically',
  'Detailed call logs and patient interaction records',
  'Transmission day tracking and device supply verification',
  'Direct audit reference for every single line item',
]
---

<section class="py-24 sm:py-32 bg-surface-container fade-in-section">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
    <div class="relative">
      <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-3 sm:p-4 rounded-sm shadow-ambient">
        <img
          src="/superbill-preview.webp"
          alt="Zayd Health RPM superbill showing patient demographics, ICD-10 diagnoses, transmission data, management time log, and billable codes"
          width="800"
          height="1100"
          class="w-full h-auto rounded-sm"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-8 -right-8 bg-tertiary p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-sm max-w-xs hidden lg:block shadow-ambient">
        <p class="text-on-tertiary font-medium text-lg mb-2">Timestamped to the second.</p>
        <p class="text-on-tertiary/80 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          When a payer asks for documentation, you have it. Detailed, precise, and indisputable.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-on-background mb-6 leading-tight">
        Audit-ready documentation, every month.
      </h2>
      <ul class="space-y-5">
        {features.map((feature) => (
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span>
            <span class="text-base sm:text-lg text-on-surface-variant">{feature}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <div class="lg:hidden mt-8 bg-tertiary p-6 rounded-sm">
        <p class="text-on-tertiary font-medium text-lg mb-2">Timestamped to the second.</p>
        <p class="text-on-tertiary/80 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          When a payer asks for documentation, you have it. Detailed, precise, and indisputable.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
